title: "AI Observatory — Verified AI and Search Crawler Retrieval Monitoring"
version: "1.0.0"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22040578"
date-released: 2026-08-21

authors:
  - family-names: "Rowley"
    given-names: "Keith"
    affiliation: "Sydney Business Web"

abstract: >
  AI Observatory is a server-side retrieval monitoring framework developed
  by Sydney Business Web. It provides observable evidence of recognised AI
  and search crawler activity, including which website resources are requested,
  whether retrievals succeed, and how machine access changes over time. It is
  designed to distinguish verified retrieval behaviour from ordinary traffic
  analytics and simple bot counting.

repository-code: "https://github.com/Sydney-Business-Web/ai-observatory"
